{"v":4,"desc":"為紀念Capcom的名作──8-bit洛克人，推出《Mega Man Legacy Collection》！\n本作收錄了系列第一至六集的內容，讓一眾洛克人支持者重溫洛克人的風采，並同時讓更多人認識洛克人能風靡全球的過人之處。\n除了六個系列作，《Mega Man Legacy Collection》還加入了「Museum Mode」及新的「Challenge Mode」。 「Challenge Mode」混合了六款游戲內不同階段的關卡，並提供各種難度以同時照顧新舊玩家的需要。而「Museum Mode」則全面性地收集了洛克人系列的歷史、高解像度的藝術品及原創概念性作品，對每個洛克人的支持者以至影像游戲歷史來說都是值得珍藏的。","publisher":"CAPCOM","release":"2018-07-19","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","葡萄牙文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/49fc408335012d30ccd5df8e4898da634ec2ed4f37bc4a49c70e01fc226f8b9e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/15ef8c1dea992eb10a3eb0d9190405689642224f61b947339dcc927ff3297594.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a7e895606e1d88f03236676d025217f70706a3fd1e0b9ce127f3e8093c774979.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e6a98e779ad19478e6bd7e8e5a3db5628df49e50732abb519a41383bf82e52bf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53e776005e1975687b85ea7bb80ebc4750324f17fe72573a4f66b105d064a0c4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/030951fee0ead9634be674bdb3cea3563d01fee131c2fb4b2914f121e79fcac5.jpg"],"titleId":"01002d4007ae0000","dlc":[]}